8,Tachelhit,https://accentnetwork.com/tachelhit/,"Afro-Asiatic.Tachelhit, also known as Shilha, is a Berber language of the Afroasiatic family. It’s mainly spoken in the Souss-Massa and Guelmim-Oued Noun regions of Morocco, with about 8 million speakers. It’s one of the major Berber languages and has several dialects.",Tachelhit,Afro-Asiatic
